+ * 
+ * vsonicarray.h
+ *     Routines to handle Sonic datum array.
+ *     SonicDatumArray is the base class to store data and flag.
+ *
+ * IDENTIFICATION
+ *        src/include/vectorsonic/vsonicarray.h
+ *
